    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis attractive four-bedroom bungalow occupies a pleasant site on the edge of Knock, approximately 1.5km from the town centre.\n\nThe property is surrounded by mature gardens to both the front and rear, with ample off-street parking. A block-built garage to the rear provides useful additional storage or workshop space.\n\nThis owner-occupied home enjoys a convenient location within easy reach of the N17, providing excellent access to surrounding towns and Ireland West Airport Knock. High-speed fibre broadband is also available, making the property well suited to family living and working from home.\n\nJoint Selling Agents: Higgins Auctioneers, Ballyhaunis.\n\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1m x 0.8m\nWith tile floor.\n\nHallway - 1.0m x 4.6m\nWith carpet floor, coving to the ceiling and Stira access to the attic.\n\nLiving Room - 4.1m x 4.0m\nBright room with solid timber floor, coving to the ceiling, electric fireplace with timber surround and a door leading to teh kitchen.\n\nKitchen - 3.8m x 3.2m\nWith lino floor, fitted kitchen with tile splashback, solid fuel range, double doors leading to the dining area and a door leading to the utility.\n\nDining Room - 3.3m x 3.6m\nWith laminate floor and a large window overlooking the rear garden, allowing for lots of natural light.\n\nUtility Room - 3.2m x 3.2m\nWith lino floor, accomodation for a washer and dryer and a door leading to the rear.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.2m x 3.2m\nWith carpet floor. EnSuite with WC and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.1m x 3.5m\nLarge double room to the rear of the house with carpet floor and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m x 4m\nLarge double room to the front of the house with carpet floor and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3m x 4m\nSingle room to the front of the house with carpet floor and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.3m x 4m\nFully tiled floor and walls with WC, wash hand basin, wet floor style shower and heated towel rail.\n\nAttic - \nFloored and shelved.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Quiet location</li><li>1.5km from Knock</li><li>Front & Rear garden</li><li>Parking to the side and rear</li><li>Block Built garage</ul>"
      },
